days.exerciseText:
// Pause **1 second** on the chest, then drive up.
Bench Press / 1x5, 1x3, 3x5 / 210lb / warmup: 1x5 45%, 1x3 65% / progress: lp(5lb)
Bent Over Row / 3x8-12 / 150lb / progress: dp(5lb, 8, 12)
Overhead Press / 3x5+ / 110lb / progress: custom(increment: 5lb) {~
  if (completedReps[ns] >= 8) {
    weights += state.increment
  } else if (completedReps[ns] < 5) {
    weights -= state.increment
  }
~}
Lateral Raise / 3x12-15 / 15lb / superset: A
Face Pull / 3x15 / 40lb / superset: A
Plank / 3x1 60s|30s
